    shrinking=True,
    cache_size=200,
    verbose=False,
    max_iter=-1
)
Param	Default	What it does
kernel	'rbf'	Shape of the decision function: 'linear', 'poly', 'rbf', 'sigmoid'.
degree	3	Only used with kernel='poly' — polynomial degree.
gamma	'scale'	Kernel coefficient for 'rbf'/'poly'/'sigmoid' — controls how far a single point's influence reaches.
coef0	0.0	Independent term, only used with 'poly'/'sigmoid'.
C	1.0	Regularization strength — inverse relationship (like LogisticRegression), lower = more regularization.
epsilon	0.1	Width of the "no penalty" margin around predictions — errors smaller than this aren't penalized at all.
shrinking	True	Uses a shrinking heuristic to speed up training.
max_iter	-1	-1 = no iteration limit.
