# NOTES
# ======================================================================
# - Every block follows the same shape: Pipeline -> param_grid (dict, using
#   'stepname__param') -> GridSearchCV -> .fit(X_train, y_train) -> best_params_
# - Regression scoring: 'r2' or 'neg_mean_squared_error'
# - Classification scoring: 'accuracy', 'f1', 'f1_weighted', 'roc_auc'
# - Trees/Forests/Boosting don't need StandardScaler - they're not
#   distance/scale sensitive - so it's left out of those pipelines.
# - Swap GridSearchCV for RandomizedSearchCV (same arguments, plus n_iter=)
#   when a grid gets too large to search exhaustively.